    "title": "<p>Requirements for rapid onsite evaluation (ROSE)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Deepali Jain",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Sufficient space in the procedure room for the microscope, spreading out slides, and staining; there must be clear access for the proceduralist to rapidly deliver the material expelled from the FNAB on to slides</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Light microscope</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">95% ethyl alcohol jars for wet fixation of slides</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Rack for air-dried slides</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Jars containing reagents for rapid staining</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">6.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">10% formalin jars for cell blocks or obvious tissue fragments/clots</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">7.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Other tubes containing media, saline, etc. for ancillary testing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">8.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Glass slides</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">9.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Pencil for labelling slides</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.1pt; text-indent: -23.1pt; \"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">10.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Personnel for ROSE</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
