    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Advantages and limitations of rapid onsite evaluation (ROSE)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Deepali Jain",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 524.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"699\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 104.35pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 524.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 104.35pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Advantages of ROSE:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Adequacy assessment with real-time guidance to the physician performing the FNAB procedure</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Increased diagnostic yield</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Appropriate guided termination of the procedure after obtaining the appropriate material</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Reduction in number of unnecessary passes and slides</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Triage of sample and ancillary testing possible</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Careful control of preanalytical factors with a possibility of sampling/testing at different sites</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Possible benefits to sample and patient management</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 46.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 524.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 46.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Limitations of ROSE:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Staff requirement&nbsp;&ndash; either a cytopathologist or a trained cytotechnologist&nbsp;must be in attendance</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Time-consuming process for which cost reimbursement is an issue in some countries </span><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29546032}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  }
]